-md\">Filter</a></p>\n<p>In dieser Demo gibt es noch viel mehr zu entdecken.<br>Weitere Informationen findest du auf <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.isotopeecommerce.org/de/\" target=\"_blank\">isotopeecommerce.org</a>.</p>', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, NULL, 'above', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'ascending', '', '', '', '', 'sourceText', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '', '', '', '', 0, NULL, 0, 4, 0, 0, '', 0, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', NULL, '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, 0, 300, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 'a:2:{i:0;s:22:\"homepage-learn-text-de\";i:1;s:5:\"col-6\";}', 0, '', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 'a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"unit\";s:2:\"h2\";}', NULL, '', NULL, '', '');
